Third-party notices
===================

UsageGauge includes the following third-party material.

Current service logo files were obtained directly from first-party sites on 2026-10-29.
Original sources are preserved. OpenAI and Claude symbols are rasterized from official SVGs,
with transparent canvas padding normalized for small displays; shapes and colors are unchanged.
Other service PNGs retain original bytes.
See assets/service-logos.json for exact URLs and verification time.
  Codex: https://openai.com/brand (official OpenAI Blossom symbol, black/white variants)
  Claude: https://claude.ai/ (official transparent symbol SVG)
  Grok: https://x.ai/legal/brand-guidelines (official logo package, light/dark variants)
  Gemini: https://gemini.google.com/ (official site icon)
  Antigravity: https://antigravity.google/press (official full-color icon)
  Aside: https://aside.com/ (official site icon)

The following historical notices are retained for attribution and source provenance.

Earlier assets/codex.png, assets/claude.png (replaced by the official files above)
  Icons taken from Win-CodexBar (https://github.com/nesszer/Win-CodexBar),
  a Windows port of CodexBar (https://github.com/steipete/CodexBar).
  Usage endpoints and token-refresh parameters were also learned from these projects.

